data: {"id": "38ae13177ef74ee5-thinking-parallel_evidence-1074", "run_id": "38ae13177ef74ee5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我将执行既有的 evidence_plan，对 Pod `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` 进行完整验证。\n\n**计划步骤：**\n1. `kubectl_describe` - 确认 Pod 状态、Last State、Exit Code、重启次数\n2. `kubectl_previous_logs` - 获取上一次崩溃前的日志\n3. `kubectl_get_yaml` - 查看容器 spec、command、资源限制\n4. `kubectl_events` - 获取关键事件\n5. `execute_pod_promql` - 确认重启趋势（baseline 已提供，可跳过或复用）\n6. `query_pod_logs` - ES 日志查询（baseline 已提供）\n7. `query_pod_tracing` - Tracing 查询（baseline 已提供）\n8. `query_pod_topology` - 拓扑关系\n\n由于 baseline 中已有 Metrics、Logging、Tracing 的结果，我将并行执行 Kube", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788791822618, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

